|.option scale=1u
|.lib "/home/ubuntu/.volare/volare/sky130/versions/c6d73a35f524070e85faff4a6a9eef49553ebc2b/sky130A/libs.tech/combined/sky130.lib.spice" tt
|
|* pre-layout subcircuit library -- design/sampler_core.spice, which carries
|* the flat `.subckt sampler_core` under test (and, inside it, `.subckt
|* sampler_dff`/`ro_array_core`/etc unmodified).
|.include "/home/ubuntu/GitHub/sky130-trng/.loom/worktrees/issue-22/design/sampler_core.spice"
|* post-layout WHOLE-CELL subcircuit library (sampler_core_pex), generated
|* from layout/sampler_core/'s composed, DRC-clean, klt lvs-matching GDS.
|.include "/home/ubuntu/GitHub/sky130-trng/.loom/worktrees/issue-22/layout/pex-sampler-core/sampler_core_pex.spice"
